    🧱 app 🛂 app policy❗️❗️

  A new policy allows nothing. A request from an origin it does not allow is
  refused with a 403 before anything behind the layer runs: the browser
  would keep the page from reading the answer either way, but it would not
  keep the request from having run. Every setter returns the policy.
